  "notes": [
    "Do NOT stage IHabboWindowManagerComponent, EventDispatcherWrapper, or Core - FFDec breaks ABC slots.",
    "Do NOT stage HabboAvatarEditor.as - FFDec mangles partSet?.clubLevel sort comparators and breaks the editor (#1009).",
    "Bobba Helper (:bobba) and Trax Machine (:traxmachine / :trax) merge into HabboWindowManagerComponent as file-private classes.",
    "Bottom-bar skull button (bobba_menu.png, next to CAMERA) is BobbaToolbarButton, also merged into HabboWindowManagerComponent.",
    "Native Presets (:presets) dump/export shell also merges into HabboWindowManagerComponent.",
    "Wired cache: incoming WiredFurni* events. Export fetch sends Open and skips prepareForUpdate so the UI stays closed.",
    "BobbaI18n loads brand-pack/i18n/{en|pt-BR|es|fr}.json (hhbr -> pt-BR, hhes -> es, hhfr -> fr, else en).",
    "Trax assets deploy from traxmachine-pack/ (local or sibling) to traxmachine/ + local_include/traxmachine/.",
    "SecureHabbo marketplace enrichment: stage MarketPlace* + inventory Marketplace*; BobbaLegacyPriceData merges with BobbaBackendClient.",
    "Placement: WME_RIGHT_CLICK on RoomDesktop cycles floor-furni preview state (scroll still rotates). RoomEngine.changeObjectState keeps SelectedRoomObjectData.state in sync so the ghost does not reset on tile move.",
    "BC Place More copies the selected floor item direction and state into the first ghost, then keeps the last ghost dir/state on each repeat (RoomObjectEventHandler)."
  ]
